  schooland_intro = COALESCE('Imperial Academy is an innovative learning centre that aims to provide a quality and comprehensive education to children. Through our driven, creative, and dynamic approaches, pupils have a fun and enlightening journey towards English language acquisition. Pupils at Imperial Academy are not educated simply to pass exams, but also to enjoy the adventure of learning and develop a lifelong appetite for knowledge. We offer a wide range of classes and activities that guide students to become active and enthusiastic participants in their education. Our interactive teaching style gives students the opportunities to be immersed in a complete and enjoyable English environment, with the aim of training them to learn and use English as a first language user.。', schooland_intro),
