  schooland_intro = COALESCE('We adopt a trilingual curriculum with a strong emphasis on languages, mathematics and sciences. With a high teacher-to-student ratio, we pride ourselves as being a caring academic community providing the best in educating the “whole child” in a global context.。We teach an integrated curriculum in a small-group setting, where children are encouraged to learn out-of-the-box and answer questions creatively. Our syllabus is founded on 3 things: 1)International focus: we take part regularly in global exchanges with schools in the U.K. Example include videoconferencing, “pen pals”, and cultural exchanges. 2)Emphasis on core subjects: Our syllabus is heavily based on international standards in the U.S. and U.K. Our children are thus encouraged to take part in international assessments like SAT10, CYLET and JET SET. 3)Activities: We work actively with external bodies to develop unique learning experiences, such as our recent videoconference with the University of Cambridge on astronomy,or our sponsorship from Prince to teach tennis to our children.', schooland_intro),
